{"seq":48,"slug":"r-statistical-computing","title":"R 语言与统计计算","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# R 语言与统计计算\n\nR 不是一门为了通用工程而生的语言，它从诞生起就把「数据与统计」放在语法的中心。向量是它的一等公民，缺失值 `NA` 是内建语义，公式 `y ~ x` 是可以传递的语言对象，绘图是标准库的一部分。理解 R 的最佳方式，不是把它当成「带统计库的脚本语言」，而是承认它是一门为交互式数据分析量身设计的函数式语言——只有接受这个前提，它那些初看古怪的设计（惰性求值、按值复制、`apply` 家族、四套对象系统）才会显出内在的一致性。\n\n这个 hub 沿着四条递进的主线展开。第一条是**语言基础与向量化**：从函数即数据、闭包与环境、惰性求值这些函数式内核出发，理解向量、列表、数据框这些承载数据的结构，最终落到「不写显式循环、用向量化与 `apply`/`purrr` 思考」的编程范式。这是其余一切的地基——R 的快与慢、优雅与笨拙，都根植于此。\n\n第二条主线是**数据处理与 Tidyverse**。真实分析里八成的时间花在整理数据上。这一章讲 dplyr 用动词与管道把数据操作写成可读的链条，讲 tidyr 背后「整洁数据」这一组织原则——每个变量一列、每个观测一行——以及 ggplot2 如何用「图形语法」把可视化拆成图层、标度、分面的正交组合。Tidyverse 不只是一组包，它是一套关于「数据应该长什么样、代码应该怎么读」的连贯哲学。\n\n第三条主线是**统计建模与推断**，这是 R 真正的主场。从线性模型 `lm` 到广义线性模型 `glm` 的统一公式接口，到假设检验与置信区间背后的推断逻辑，再到不依赖正态假设、用计算换理论的重抽样与自助法。R 让「拟合一个模型」和「对结论做不确定性量化」同样自然。\n\n第四条主线是**工程化与生态**：当分析需要被复现、被分享、被加速时，R Markdown 与 Shiny 把代码变成可交互的文档与应用，Rcpp 与 data.table 把瓶颈代码提速一到两个数量级，而包开发与 renv 则让一次分析能在另一个人、另一台机器、另一年被原样重跑。\n\n四条主线层层递进：先能写、再会理数据、然后会建模与推断、最后让成果工程化且可复现。读完整个 hub，你应当既能流畅地用 R 做端到端的数据分析，也理解每一步背后的语言机制与统计原理。各章引言会进一步说明本章在这条路径上的位置。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"语言基础与向量化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"r-language-core","title":"R 语言核心与函数式特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/foundations/r-language-core"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vectors-data-frames","title":"向量、列表与数据框","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/foundations/vectors-data-frames"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vectorization-apply","title":"向量化与 apply 家族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/foundations/vectorization-apply"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tidyverse","title":"数据处理与 Tidyverse","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/tidyverse","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dplyr-data-wrangling","title":"dplyr 数据整理与管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/tidyverse/dplyr-data-wrangling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tidyr-data-reshaping","title":"tidyr 与整洁数据原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/tidyverse/tidyr-data-reshaping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ggplot2-visualization","title":"ggplot2 与图形语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistics","title":"统计建模与推断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-models","title":"线性与广义线性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/statistical-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hypothesis-inference","title":"假设检验与统计推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/hypothesis-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"resampling-bootstrap","title":"重抽样、自助法与模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/resampling-bootstrap"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程化与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rmarkdown-shiny","title":"R Markdown 与 Shiny 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/practice/rmarkdown-shiny"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-rcpp","title":"性能优化与 Rcpp","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/practice/performance-rcpp"},{"seq":3,"slug":"packages-reproducibility","title":"包开发与可复现研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/practice/packages-reproducibility"}]}]}